From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Derek Ross <derekross@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 11 Oct 2026 20:18:15 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] dt-bindings: i2c: exynos5: add Google gs201 compatible

The HSI2C controllers of the Google gs201 (Tensor G2) SoC are the same
as on gs101 and work with the ExynosAuto v9 programming model.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 Documentation/devicetree/bindings/i2c/i2c-exynos5.yaml | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/i2c/i2c-exynos5.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/i2c/i2c-exynos5.yaml
index 32269239b..8b4332942 100644
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/i2c/i2c-exynos5.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/i2c/i2c-exynos5.yaml
@@ -40,6 +40,7 @@ properties:
       - items:
           - enum:
               - google,gs101-hsi2c
+              - google,gs201-hsi2c
               - samsung,exynos2200-hsi2c
               - samsung,exynos850-hsi2c
               - samsung,exynos990-hsi2c
